{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>How long will you refuse.</b> Since you do not humble yourself even now that you have witnessed My power over the surrounding air, without which you cannot live even for a moment, there is no hope that you will relent on account of the magnitude of any plagues. But perhaps you will relent on account of their persistence over a long time; therefore it is fitting to ask until what point in time the persistence of refusal will endure along with the persistence of the plagues."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:59.545595309Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}